{
  "message": "Thank you for letting me know. Since your phone is still showing no signal and mentions a missing SIM card, let's try reseating your SIM card. Please power off your phone, remove the SIM card, wait a few seconds, and then reinsert it securely. Power your phone back on and let me know if you see any change in your service or if the SIM card is recognized."
